{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roll dice and reach for the stars!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/f5905ae574ff06b0f3f2b685410f70b4.poster.avif?t=1754532344\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/f5905ae574ff06b0f3f2b685410f70b4.webm?t=1754532344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/f5905ae574ff06b0f3f2b685410f70b4.mp4?t=1754532344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll dice to make scoring hands in this push-your-luck roguelike. Chase an ever-increasing high score by building wild combos with unique dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/c2be7d8d85bc4dd8087a7e62d91daef7.poster.avif?t=1754532344\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/c2be7d8d85bc4dd8087a7e62d91daef7.webm?t=1754532344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter the shop and see what's for sale!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/c6d44b372c34b26bc9cb829419c89f58.poster.avif?t=1754532344\" width=616 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/c6d44b372c34b26bc9cb829419c89f58.webm?t=1754532344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/c6d44b372c34b26bc9cb829419c89f58.mp4?t=1754532344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your winnings to buy new scoring hands, powerful unique dice, and strange pins that can drastically alter your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/588ec24530a823a98fb8a6d0dd2ef3c4.poster.avif?t=1754532344\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/588ec24530a823a98fb8a6d0dd2ef3c4.webm?t=1754532344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plan your path as you climb ever upward!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/cbd3331511f9022a218fddeb3fec0be3.poster.avif?t=1754532344\" width=616 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/cbd3331511f9022a218fddeb3fec0be3.webm?t=1754532344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/cbd3331511f9022a218fddeb3fec0be3.mp4?t=1754532344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through the levels and face off against rule-breaking bosses that force you to adapt. Build your strategy around them, or come crashing down to Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/dc181919260cfa15fde67f44c06294a9.poster.avif?t=1754532344\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/dc181919260cfa15fde67f44c06294a9.webm?t=1754532344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike + Progression!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/14416bd987af990767af744afe1280af.poster.avif?t=1754532344\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/14416bd987af990767af744afe1280af.webm?t=1754532344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete runs to unlock harder difficulties and earn new starting dice bags for use in the Challenge Mode. Unlock new dice, items, and scoring hands by completing achievements, or unlock everything instantly with the press of a button (if that\u2019s how you like your roguelikes).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ dice with unique faces and abilities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three dozen scoring hands with distinct rules to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ items that alter the odds in your favor </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for 30-minute runs with infinite replayability  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your limits in Endless Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your hand in\u00a0Challenge Mode\u00a0using unique dice bags </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep strategy meets chaotic dice-rolling engine building</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2443590?t=1754532344","backgr